{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-This is the story of one wish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/extras/5452e8b00b32a0f53b8fc005ca67a720.avif?t=1759229488\" width=1200 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollow Sorrow is a story-driven exploration adventure game with the theme of &quot;facing the past&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Currently, the main game is only available in Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Story]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting is Yunekeel, a land of longing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a &quot;miracle that grants wishes&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, only the &quot;sinless&quot; can receive this miracle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Patrania, is a young man with amnesia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All he remembers is that he &quot;had a wish he wanted to fulfill&quot; and that &quot;he once committed a crime&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To remember his past, atone for his sins, and fulfill his wish, he wanders into a fantastical &quot;The world of memories&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your role is to guide him and remember the past together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the past is not bright.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, the full extent of his sins will be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you can make this journey a happy one depends on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/extras/0c5119f94f18aa7c2744d5a32027f96a.avif?t=1759229488\" width=1008 height=499 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[How to play]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the &quot;The world of memories&quot; and collect fragments of memories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Judge whether the collected memories are good or bad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The world and ending change depending on the accumulation of choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choices sometimes affect the fate of characters other than the protagonist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy to play volume</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Warm and unique fantasy world view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Conversations with characters with various pasts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Heartfelt story depicting hope and rebirth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It's up to you to turn the story into despair</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There's no turning back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/extras/ca6f2b5c1fe284e17f89acdf0978263f.poster.avif?t=1759229488\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/extras/ca6f2b5c1fe284e17f89acdf0978263f.webp?t=1759229488\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=194 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[About distribution]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live play and monetization are permitted within the bounds of public order and morals. If you like, please paste the URL of this store page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, don't forget to be considerate of spoilers and extreme scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515060?t=1759229488","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/5eadc5855d69704133a48a7ada8335697e738383/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759229488","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s