d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you can make this journey a happy one depends on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/extras/0c5119f94f18aa7c2744d5a32027f96a.avif?t=1759229488\" width=1008 height=499 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[How to play]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the &quot;The world of memories&quot; and collect fragments of memories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Judge whether the collected memories are good or bad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The world and ending change depending on the accumulation of choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choices sometimes affect the fate of characters other than the protagonist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy to play volume</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Warm and unique fantasy world view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Conversations with characters with various pasts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Heartfelt story depicting hope and rebirth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It's up to you to turn the story into despair</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There's no turning back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/extras/ca6f2b5c1fe284e17f89acdf0978263f.poster.avif?t=1759229488\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/extras/ca6f2b5c1fe284e17f89acdf0978263f.webp?t=1759229488\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=194 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[About distribution]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live play and monetization are permitted within the bounds of public order and morals. If you like, please paste the URL of this store page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, don't forget to be considerate of spoilers and extreme scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u30a2\u30ce\u30ce\u30cd"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/header.jpg?t=1759229488","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u30db\u30ed\u30a6\u30bd\u30ed\u30a6","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10300H or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL compatible VRAM 1 GB or more<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["\u30a2\u30ce\u30ce\u30cd"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nTemas sens\u00edveis","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Selbstmord","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/9bfc22d39e8430df724de67bba44e3d317225f47/ss_9bfc22d39e8430df724de67bba44e3d317225f47.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759229488","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/9bfc22d39e8430df724de67bba44e3d317225f47/ss_9bfc22d39e8430df724de67bba44e3d317225f47.600x338.jpg?t=1759229488"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515060/1958b8e13443ae78fb8bf15a45aebaa139a3f75d/ss_1958b8e13443ae78fb8bf15a45aebaa139a3f75d.1920x1080.